<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Cross-Platform Scaling of Vision-Language-Action Models from Edge to Cloud GPUs 
<br class="ltx_break"></h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Amir Taherin<sup id="id1" class="ltx_sup">1</sup>
</span></span>
